 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Amazon Polly API (2016-06-10). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Pronunciation lexicons are stored PLS documents that are never applied: SynthesizeSpeech, speech synthesis tasks and DescribeVoices return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. PutLexicon checks that Content is a PLS lexicon element with an ipa or x-sampa alphabet, a supported xml:lang, at most 4,000 characters and lexemes of at most 100 characters; it creates or replaces the lexicon. Lexicon attributes report LexiconArn and LastModified but not Alphabet, LanguageCode, LexemesCount or Size.",
  "title": "Amazon Polly (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2016-06-10"
 },
